    "binders": [
      "q is a state depending on one spatial coordinate x and time t, with inherited notation q : ℝ × ℝ → ℝᵐ; m is the number of state components. [Raw PDF p. 23, printed p. 1, notation following (1.1); raw PDF p. 26, printed p. 4, opening paragraph.]",
